# Python bytecode cache -- build artifacts, never source, should never be
# committed. Found 4 tracked .pyc files this session (tools/__pycache__/*)
# during a quality-control pass -- untracked below, and this .gitignore rule
# added so they can't be accidentally re-added in the future.
__pycache__/
*.pyc


